{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/202605-all-hail-the-dark-lord","id":202605,"title":"All Hail The Dark Lord","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-19T21:07:09-07:00","id":202605,"title":"All Hail The Dark Lord","content":"So one of the players in my group wanted to play a Tolkienian elf in Changeling, something to the tune of Legolas.It's not impossible to do this; tolkien elves kinda lend themselves to Fairest seeming, though the player really didn't like the original kiths. What occured afterwards spiraled, however, into a discussion of different characters from LotR and Silmarilliiion..... which then let to us trying to figure out how a player would go about playing Sauron: the Changeling. There were lots of interesting angles to go with this: Smith-Wizened for his ringmaking, Fairest for his elf-gifting, Ogre for his Dark Lording. Help us out here, please.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T21:15:30-07:00","id":202626,"title":"","content":"I feel as though you'd have to pick an aspect and diversify from there; Sauron's like resonates a little more with the Fae than the Lost, as far as my (grossly limited) understanding of Tolkien's milieu can suggest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T02:43:24-07:00","id":202780,"title":"","content":"Sauron's a Keeper!<br /> <br /> If you want him statted, dual kith Fairest/Wizened. Draconian Fairest works well, and wizened Smith would be the best way to make the rings. Take Giant and then commence being terrifying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T02:45:06-07:00","id":202782,"title":"","content":"I am also gonna back Sauron as a Keeper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T06:02:25-07:00","id":202841,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only-less-evil-462816558Yes\" target=\"_blank\">http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only...l-462816558Yes</a>, making him a Keeper would make a lot of sense. But it still feels like the player wants a 'dark lord in training' version.<br /> I suppose that would fit under Ogres, since they tend to become the monsters that abused them.<br /> <img src=\"http://fc04.deviantart.net/fs71/f/2014/173/1/2/only_less_evil__by_tueri-d7njrji.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only-less-evil-462816558\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/e0f5f1ed-e8ca-45e8-ae72-38e0c23f98de/d7njrji-77278249-780a-4b55-a9ff-fbbfd773e179.png/v1/fill/w_731,h_1093/only_less_evil__by_esquitor_d7njrji-pre.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3HwSKsnec-mI2pFFP6wufxcFVEZj-U_AvZ4BCbbycto\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only-less-evil-462816558\" target=\"_blank\"> only less evil. by esquitor on DeviantArt </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only-less-evil-462816558\" target=\"_blank\"> http://tueri.deviantart.com/art/only-less-evil-462816558 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> only less evil. &mdash; artwork by esquitor on DeviantArt. Published: 2014-06-22 &middot; Likes: 100 &middot; Views: 4463 &middot; Comments: 2 </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":306,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","user":"Brasstreader","date":". 07-20-2014, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T12:51:34-07:00","id":204104,"title":"","content":"Sauron could probably be an Ogre for the following reasons<br /> <br /> <br /> 1 - Twice as tall as most people on the battlefield<br /> <br /> <br /> 2 - Sends whole groups of enemies flying with one blow.<br /> <br /> <br /> But yeah, he'd probably be a Keeper, since his power was used to corrupt and warp people from their original forms. (Nazgul, and Golum, for example)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T18:32:50-07:00","id":208947,"title":"","content":"Sauron could be an Ogre with the dual kiths merit, plus the troll and artist kiths, to represent his strength, talent for manipulation and crafting ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T05:35:00-07:00","id":211113,"title":"","content":"Had to take a trip to Wikipedia to verify, but Celebrimbor actually smithed the Rings, Sauron &quot;merely&quot; corrupted them as they were being made. So still a Wizened, but not a Smith.<br /> <br /> About the Ogre aspects, I'm certain someone of Sauron's moxie would have a few Tokens to make himself more badass in combat.<br /> <br /> Another backing for Sauron as a Keeper, not sure how those are statted up.....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T06:13:44-07:00","id":211140,"title":"","content":"My Tolkien-fu is weak, but Sauron used to be a shapeshifter who often took werewolf form and later took beautiful forms to corrupt and deceive - at Numenor and with the creation of the rings. But he lost much of his power and, by LOTR, can only take monstrous form. He's also one of the angel-things (Maia?) of the Valar God/Archangel of creation/forging. So, I can see Darkling, Ogre, Fairest, Beast and Wizened in there... Keeper is the way to go, especially with the ring as a clear Prop. He's been losing titles, becoming weaker, and the ring is his last Title so he wants it desperately...<br /> <br /> As a player, I'd personally go Darkling. Sauron as Dark Lord ruling Mordor and leading vast armies took some time - most of the time he was corrupting and working in the shadows. For a 'young' Sauron, Darkling seems great and goes with his general shadowy theme. And it doesn't rule out his later awesome might. Being a dark lord isn't about being a big bruiser. Dark Lords hire them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 07-28-2014, 09:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T03:51:03-07:00","id":212295,"title":"","content":"Some of the things you mentioned give me a Draconic vibe more than anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2198-malkavian87","name":"Malkavian87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2198_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T22:52:32-07:00","id":217193,"title":"","content":"For myself I would most likely make him a Wizened Smith due to both making the Ring, providing the knowledge to forge the other rings and also because he was initially tied to Aul\u00eb, who is after all the vala of crafts and smithing.<br /> <br /> But I kind of agree that he would be a Keeper, probably one a loyalist Wizened Smith who returned to Arcadia after the destruction of his former master.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":970,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","user":"Gurkhal","date":". 08-03-2014, 01:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}